title: Another program on the guest's side (an extension, an assistant) appends to a file, makes a new one in a new folder and a file is deleted there: the host's folder follows each
folders: share-text
limit: 80
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: share: Beto made made/by-guest.txt
expect-log: share: Beto removed other.txt
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: line 12\nappended on the guest's side\n$
expect-file: share-text\made\by-guest.txt :: ^made on the guest's side\n$
absent-file: share-text\other.txt
guest-expect-log: share: notes.txt changed on this side
guest-expect-log: share: made/by-guest.txt is new on this side

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 34000
fit
wait 1500
mark host-after-the-guests-changes
wait 1500
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 5000
touch notes.txt appended on the guest's side
wait 4000
touch made/by-guest.txt made on the guest's side
wait 8000
delete other.txt
wait 600
answer Delete
wait 7000
fit
wait 1500
mark guest-after-its-changes
wait 1500
quit
wait 1500
